  "prompt": "For each UTC day from 1 July to 31 October 2025 on which at least one user signed up (signup_ts holds UTC time), show the number of signups that day and the 7-day average of daily signups: the signups of the 7 calendar days ending on that day, divided by 7, rounded to 2 decimals. A day with no signups counts as 0, and the 7 days may reach back into June. Return three columns, in this order: signup_date, signups and avg_signups_7d. Return one row for each such day. Any row order is fine.",
